":"HTA resistente","guid":"6gig13CPSl-x4ID8iUuuGQ","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"168","text":"FA + somnolencia diurna","guid":"9qP-J5SLRpCsNo0WgyBmRA","children":[]},{"id":"171","parent":"168","text":"IC descompensada inexplicada","guid":"AD5NSIm7R0imZO1-XPFCcQ","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"168","text":"Deterioro cognitivo + ronquido","guid":"WOyDT_yKRY6J1tN9gem6xQ","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"168","text":"ACV reciente","guid":"5ApnvaGHSjCQ9wSGge_hzA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"174","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"fUBOLt3uQH2uwYELbjafGA","children":[{"id":"175","parent":"174","text":"AOS presente en ~50% de pacientes con FA → BUSCAR ACTIVAMENTE","guid":"55XMUgI9TvKSPm8Edskr8Q","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"174","text":"NICTURIA en AM = síntoma cardinal de AOS (no solo próstata)","guid":"HBL7RLFVTtmoHMzB-GkCDw","children":[]},{"id":"177","parent":"174","text":"CPAP reduce recurrencia FA post-ablación en ~40-50%","guid":"GLoUsFaqQE-bfhiTG1W5TA","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"174","text":"Score MUTCH-AF ≥5 → especificidad 96% para AOS en FA","guid":"ae7tzl3GSn2q38wn9ADpmg","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"174","text":"T90 y carga hipóxica → MEJORES predictores CV que IAH solo","guid":"Iczg3tqFTEKoZ7Q474RTYg","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"174","text":"Paciente delgado NO descarta AOS → 20-40% no son obesos","guid":"yeDKqii_QDWEZwnaV-U0fg","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"174","text":"FA refractaria a tratamiento → considerar AOS como causa","guid":"DGa-wr_dScSRsbyUg6Ef1A","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"174","text":"Sin CPAP → tasa fracaso ablación de FA se DUPLICA","guid":"mUpYY9UnTsGHQSQI_bmlJg","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"174","text":"Poligrafía domiciliaria → alternativa válida y costo-efectiva en AM","guid":"NfoV45TmSJO4Ld7sIIL8AA","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"174","text":"Involucrar al CUIDADOR en adherencia CPAP del AM","guid":"6WOJWCy8QG6cTe8K34BZZw","children":[]},{"id":"185"